{"identity_key": "x:2107700787623452680", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2107700787623452680", "title": null, "content": "就在明天！妹系羅盤、蘇菲亞、空狐同步於Steam發售✨\n\n大家已經準備好在這週假日好好玩個痛快了嗎？⁽⁽ଘ( ˙꒳˙ )ଓ⁾⁾\n\n讓小編來帶著大家一起檢查一下你是否做好準備吧！\n\n\n\n✅ 打開akaeorCore STEAM頁面📖\n\n✅ 把「妹系羅盤、蘇菲亞、空狐」加入願望清單\n\n✅ 準備愉快雀躍的心情準備開玩\n\n\n\n🧭妹系羅盤：https://nitter.cf/t.co/n8Kz9wwqKC\n\n⛄️我與蘇菲亞的秘密：https://nitter.cf/t.co/y61dZFKsDG\n\n🦊我與空狐的日常：https://nitter.cf/t.co/9CFTXioycM\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #妹系羅盤在無人島的悠哉慢活 #我與蘇菲亞的秘密 #我與空狐的日常", "publisher": "akaerocore", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaerocore/status/2107700787623452680", "published_at": "2026-10-07T05:13:21+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Wed, 07 Oct 2026 05:13:21 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:44.474889+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaerocore", "author_name": "akaerocore", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
